╭ settings ────────────╮╭ checkouts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮╭ add a folder ──────────────────────────────────────╮
│GitLab                ││  + add a folder to look in   paste or type a folder                            ││ Another folder to look for git checkouts in. radar │
│  ├─ connection       ││ folder     /work                                                       3 found ││ matches each checkout to its repo by its origin    │
│  └─ projects         ││ look down  4 folders                                                           ││ remote.                                            │
│Slack ⋯               ││ last look  2m ago                                                      3 found ││                                                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ACCEPTS                                            │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ a full path, or one starting with ~/ (pasted links │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ to files work too)                                 │
