│                      ││                                                                                ││ 1 folder                                           │
│                      ││                                                                                ││                                                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ config: [git] roots                                │
│                      ││                                                                                ││                                                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ▪ WHAT IT READS ────────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   The git checkouts under these folders, as far    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   down as look down.                               │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   New clones inside them show up at the next look. │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   With git on this machine: branches, changes,     │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   ahead, behind.                                   │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ⎇ WHERE IT SHOWS ───────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Branches (B): every branch in these checkouts.   │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   A repo or merge request: where it is checked     │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   out, e and t.                                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Agents start in the checkout you pick.           │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ⚙ CHANGE IT LATER ──────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Settings / git / checkouts                       │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ℹ SKIP IT? ─────────────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Branches stay empty until a folder is set.       │
