│                      ││  ● read only       pull requests, checks, runs                                 ││   Choose gh's sign-in. Not signed in yet?          │
│                      ││  ○ read and write  adds comment, approve, merge, re-run                        ││   $ gh auth login                                  │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   cli.github.com: install gh                       │
│                      ││  REPOSITORIES  github.com/owner, owner/repo or a group name                    ││ ⇌ OR A TOKEN ───────────────────────────────────── │
