exports[`recorded view fixtures through the whole App > gitlab_settings-connection_160x40.json at 160x40 1`] = `
" radar    ▤ Repositories ●   ◇ Jira   ✉ Slack ●   ⎇ Branches   Work items   ≣ History   ⚙ Settings (,)          ⠷ local annotations · observations only  ✎ edit
╭ settings ────────────╮╭ connection ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮╭ server ────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│GitLab                ││  server          https://gitlab.com                                            ││ CHECKED                                            │
│  ├─ connection       ││  base group      acme                                                          ││ not checked yet                                    │
│  └─ projects         ││  token           env:GITLAB_TOKEN                                              ││                                                    │
│Slack ⋯               ││  signed in as    me                                                            ││ NOW                                                │
│                      ││  check           not checked yet                                               ││ https://gitlab.com                                 │
│                      ││  refresh         every 1m                                                      ││                                                    │
│                      ││  merged, closed  the last 14 days                                              ││ The GitLab server radar talks to.                  │
│                      ││                                                                                ││                                                    │
│                      ││  ACCESS  what radar may do in GitLab                                           ││ ACCEPTS                                            │
│                      ││  ● read only       merge requests, pipelines, diffs      read_api              ││ https://gitlab.com or your own server's address    │
│                      ││  ○ read and write  adds comment, approve, merge, rebase  api                   ││                                                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ config: [gitlab] url                               │
│                      ││  FOLLOW  groups and repositories                                               ││                                                    │
│                      ││  + add a group or repository   paste a link or a path                          ││ ⇌ GET A GITLAB TOKEN ───────────────────────────── │
│                      ││    ◆ b     acme/team-b   0 repos · 1 open MR                                   ││   1 Open GitLab's new-token page:                  │
│                      ││    ◆ a     acme/team-a   4 repos · 3 open MRs                                  ││   gitlab.com / new token   open · copy             │
│                      ││                                                                                ││     name radar · scope from access: read_api       │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   2 Pick an expiry date, then Create personal      │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   access token.                                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   3 Copy the glpat-… value into token, or keep it  │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   out of radar's config:                           │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   $ export GITLAB_TOKEN=glpat-…                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││     then the token is env:GITLAB_TOKEN             │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ $ ALREADY USE GLAB? ────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Type glab as the token. Not signed in?           │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   $ glab auth login                                │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ⊕ YOUR OWN GITLAB ──────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Set server first; the link above then points at  │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   your server's page.                              │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ⚠ IF IT IS REFUSED ─────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Expired, or without read_api: make a new one     │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   with the link.                                   │
