│                      ││                                                                                ││   ↗  open documentation · GitHub: install Copilot  │
│                      ││ provider              Copilot                                                  ││   CLI                                              │
│                      ││ model                 the provider's own                                       ││ ◙ CODEX  checking ──────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││ working folder        where radar was started                                  ││   $ npm i -g @openai/codex                         │
│                      ││ permitted folders     none                                                     ││   $ codex login                                    │
│                      ││ skill folders         none                                                     ││   ↗  Codex: install and sign in                    │
│                      ││ CLI's own config      yes                                                      ││ ◙ CLAUDE AGENT  checking ───────────────────────── │
│                      ││ always allow          none                                                     ││   $ npm i -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code             │
│                      ││ always deny           none                                                     ││   $ claude auth login                              │
│                      ││ local only            yes                                                      ││   radar runs your own claude and offers no sign-in │
│                      ││ reviewer commands     yes                                                      ││   of its own.                                      │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   Anthropic does not allow a claude.ai login in a  │
│                      ││ RECIPES AND REVIEWS                                                            ││   product: for one it asks for an API key          │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY).                             │
│                      ││ recipes folder        ~/.config/radar/recipes                                  ││   ↗  Claude Code: set up                           │
│                      ││ recipe ask            v1 · built-in                                            ││ $ ANY OTHER CLI ────────────────────────────────── │
│                      ││ recipe review-mr      v1 · built-in                                            ││   add a command takes what you would type in a     │
│                      ││ reviews folder        radar's state folder                                     ││   terminal; radar runs it in a tab of the dock.    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ ⚠ NOTHING IS APPROVED FOR YOU ──────────────────── │
│                      ││ WHILE YOU ARE AWAY                                                             ││   A request waits in the dock for your answer:     │
│                      ││                                                                                ││   approve · session · deny · view diff             │
